{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>MIRROR成員江𤒹生（AK）昨晚（22日）膺金馬男配角，出席完慶功宴後稍作休息，今早（23日）便啟程返港為MIRROR演唱會排舞，今天中午12時許，AK拿着金馬獎抵港，現場已有逾百生粉（粉絲暱稱）守候並歡呼，他們還舉起Banner賀偶像獲獎：「恭喜江𤒹生 我們的金馬最佳男配角 生粉以你為傲」，AK捧着獎座跟粉絲合照，他還興奮親吻獎座。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T06:11:02.052626+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T05:13:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T11:57:28.068674+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T06:04:35.192846+00:00","content_hash":"e2de704e977fda31df461cb90e59a047a1eee39bf73454a2c8a8f5b997e59d94","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}